WEBVTT

1
00:00:12.005 --> 00:00:22.659
The unicorn charged after Tom.

2
00:00:22.660 --> 00:00:25.541
"Help!" Princess Mary yelled.

3
00:00:25.542 --> 00:00:28.211
Cat jumped in front of the unicorn.

4
00:00:28.212 --> 00:00:32.880
The unicorn tossed Cat up with her horn.

5
00:00:32.881 --> 00:00:35.046
Tom waved his wand.

6
00:00:35.047 --> 00:00:36.618
"Help Cat!"

7
00:00:36.619 --> 00:00:42.289
Poof! Bright red sparks flew out of his wand.

8
00:00:42.290 --> 00:00:47.623
"That's no help!" Tom moaned.

9
00:00:47.624 --> 00:00:51.255
The ogre in the next clearing was angry.

10
00:00:51.256 --> 00:00:55.802
"Who woke me up?" he cried.

11
00:00:55.803 --> 00:00:59.590
He saw bright red sparks through the trees.

12
00:00:59.591 --> 00:01:02.269
The ogre ran toward them.

13
00:01:02.270 --> 00:01:06.358
The unicorn pointed her sharp horn at Tom.

14
00:01:06.359 --> 00:01:11.026
"No one gets away with tricking me!" she said.

15
00:01:11.027 --> 00:01:15.041
Just then the ogre crashed into the clearing.

16
00:01:15.042 --> 00:01:19.654
He roared at the unicorn.

17
00:01:19.655 --> 00:01:22.809
The unicorn groaned.

18
00:01:22.810 --> 00:01:24.962
"Not you again!"

19
00:01:24.963 --> 00:01:27.285
The ogre ran at the unicorn.

20
00:01:27.286 --> 00:01:31.479
They started to fight.

21
00:01:31.480 --> 00:01:34.212
Cat jumped into Tom's pocket.

22
00:01:34.213 --> 00:01:36.780
Tom grabbed Princess Mary's hand.

23
00:01:36.781 --> 00:01:44.490
"Run!" he said.

24
00:01:44.491 --> 00:01:48.927
They ran through the Dark Forest.

25
00:01:48.928 --> 00:01:57.097
They did not stop until they reached the castle.

26
00:01:57.098 --> 00:02:01.334
"I'm so glad to be home!" Princess Mary said.

27
00:02:01.335 --> 00:02:04.161
"Thank you for rescuing me, Tom."

28
00:02:04.162 --> 00:02:07.492
"You're welcome," Tom said, blushing.

29
00:02:07.493 --> 00:02:10.508
The king ran up.

30
00:02:10.509 --> 00:02:14.090
"Where did you go?" he asked the princess.

31
00:02:14.091 --> 00:02:16.747
"For a walk," she said.

32
00:02:16.748 --> 00:02:20.438
"Tom saved me from a mean unicorn!"

33
00:02:20.439 --> 00:02:24.683
"Tom is a wonderful wizard!" the king said.

34
00:02:24.684 --> 00:02:29.145
Tom bowed.

35
00:02:29.146 --> 00:02:39.198
Cat licked her paws.
